<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-17file-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Eldredgeops rana_17file Turing wavelength at 342 nm (Tioughniogan, 384 Ma) — MorphoEval overall 89.8/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 keeps lambda_c = 342 nm and the 18-to-17 file step. The D_v sweep shortens lambda_c monotonically from 359.6 nm to 335.4 nm. Equal diffusion gives sigma_max = -0.082 and the seeded field decays. A quadratic transmitted-light readout of the radial activator and inhibitor matches the gallery plate at Pearson r = 0.9987, RMSE = 1.02 gray levels, KS = 0.083. The 18-file predecessor cell at the same wavelength is 371.5 nm across versus 393.3 nm for the 17-file cell. Computer-vision similarity of the 12-frame 640x480 GIF against the plate is 92.0. Overall 89.8/100 (faithfulness 89.9, reproducibility 89.5); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 90, Morphological realism / specimen match 90, Parameter expressivity 88, Morphometric validation 91, Source and data traceability 90, Code-to-model traceability 88, Reproducibility package 90. Output judged: docs/media/eldredgeops_rana_17file_turing_wavelength_s0_growth.gif: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-17file-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc, image/gif, 2540262 B, 640×480 px, 12 frames, artifact_sha256 4d0865ff0676b4ea86c79cf0f4f473b191084605e20892f4eb03be46789fc5fd (sha256 4d0865ff0676b4ea86c79cf0f4f473b191084605e20892f4eb03be46789fc5fd), spec_fingerprint 85220eeb3c45cab3b7d0f79029a67be0c2bd7ed30f186a58a8339bf5949289d0. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 85220eeb3c45cab3b7d0f79029a67be0c2bd7ed30f186a58a8339bf5949289d0; artifact_sha256: 4d0865ff0676b4ea86c79cf0f4f473b191084605e20892f4eb03be46789fc5fd. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-27-eldredgeops-rana-17file-turing-wavelength-s0-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing 1952 selects a finite critical wavenumber when the two morphogens diffuse at different rates. | Eldredge 1972 documents a step from 18 to 17 dorsoventral lens files between the Cazenovian and Tioughniogan horizons. | Lindgren et al. 2019 show a screening pigment associated with fossil arthropod eyes, which is the anatomical context for a pigment-ring wavelength.; reconstructed_in_script: Schnakenberg parameters rho_a=0.082, rho_b=0.918, D_u=0.060, D_v=1.200, periodic cell 1.15 lambda_c, seed 3216. | Quadratic optical readout I = c0 + c1 u_hat + c2 v_hat + c3 u_hat^2 + c4 v_hat^2 fit to the plate's radial luminance. | Predecessor cell side scaled by 17/18 at fixed lambda_c = 342 nm.; transfer_boundary: The gallery plate is a radial ocellus field with a labeled 100 micrometre bar (measured 111 px, 0.901 µm/px). Comparison is dimensionless radial shape plus computer-vision texture, not a claim that the plate's field of view is 342 nm.; does_not_claim: That 342 nm was measured on a Tioughniogan lens. | That the self-similar predecessor wavelength 323 nm is the law used here. | That a second independent assessor has scored this script.." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:hasScore 8.98e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-17file-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Eldredgeops rana_17file Turing wavelength at 342 nm (Tioughniogan, 384 Ma) — Parameter expressivity: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "At fixed kinetics and D_u, lambda_c falls monotonically as D_v runs through 0.48, 0.72, 1.20, 2.00, 3.20: 359.6, 349.5, 342.0, 337.7, 335.4 nm. That is the direction k_c^2 = f_u/(2 D_u) + g_v/(2 D_v) predicts, because g_v is negative. rho_a is not swept." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/parameter-expressivity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-17file-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-17file-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

